{"title":"Brigand","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=16\" title=\"Pick level 16\"><td><b>16</b></td><td>50</td><td>13.3</td><td>800</td><td class=\"muted\">150 · 18.6 · 2,400</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>11</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9b1cfb78d1f46e754be0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/0e81ab2e03055fb04c81.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/76081a6b6cba8a6e67c9.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/a9228150422aac9a6b04.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9b1cfb78d1f46e754be0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 7 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 7 looted corpses, 22 recorded drops, 619 total, 13–77 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 43% of 7 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 14 total, 3–7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">43% · 3/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-medium\" title=\"Mana Potion Medium - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dce7b61a763deccad88f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-spear\" title=\"Silver Spear - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"feathered-cap-green\" title=\"Feathered Cap Green - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/79007a374862508e9d7f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Feathered Cap Green</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-boots\" title=\"Bandit Boots - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dd2db2b8fc51fb829fa.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Boots</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Bandit Hole</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 9</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-92\">Layout</button></li><li><b>Bandit Cave</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 7</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-71\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-4194.4px,-1688.7px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/15/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/15/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:1792px\"><i style=\"left:4194.4px;top:1688.7px\"></i></div><figcaption>Wolfden</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"brigand\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/brask-the-mole\"><img src=\"data/img/219b427558814faec045.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Brask the Mole</b><span>Lv 18</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bandit: <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">Cutthroat</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">Outlaw Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/0e81ab2e03055fb04c81.webp\" alt=\"Brigand\"></div><h3